# web build context (repo root). Exclude only the clearly-safe heavy/irrelevant stuff —
# install fresh, build fresh. (Only applies to the repo-root Dockerfile / web service;
# the relayer service builds from packages/relayer with its own context.)
**/node_modules
**/.next
.git
.claude
.cursor
.DS_Store
**/*.log
.env.local
**/.env.local
# runtime 用不到的重物：文件、簡報、技能說明
docs
pitch
skills
